abstract: "Sentinel is an open-source agent trust engine and security scanner for AI coding assistant instruction files (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, .cursorrules, .mcp.json, settings.json). It provides static precision rules, Time-Warp multi-moment sandbox detonation, an Instruction Doctor with deterministic hygiene checks, and a CI-signed AGENTS.lock."
